{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"user-2","name":"プロデューサー","text":"──あぁ……凛世、これって……","trans":"──啊……凛世，这个是……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-6","name":"プロデューサー","text":"……ぁっと、凛世、待ってくれ\r\nこれ、その──","trans":"……啊、凛世，等等\n这个，那个──","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901008120020","name":"凛世","text":"──ぎりぎり義理で……\r\nございます……","trans":"──勉勉强强，算是义理……\n巧克力……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-11","name":"プロデューサー","text":"えっ、ぎりぎり──？","trans":"诶，勉勉强强──？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-14","name":"プロデューサー","text":"──と、その……\r\nチョコ……かな、ありがとう","trans":"──那、那个……\n巧克力……吧，谢谢","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901008120050","name":"凛世","text":"はい……────","trans":"是……────","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true}],"additionalSources":[{"id":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","package":"enza-player-app-fix.zip","dictionary":"data/translations/zh_dynamic.json","sha256":"63c8feb976e689fa7d5b8d21e48ce143c9f462fdaa8a2d1c3367e9c7fccefd98","credit":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）"}]}